1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
some mistakes and how to fix it.
一些失误，以及怎么改正

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,460
i think everyone does mistake in a match
我觉得每个人在比赛里都会犯错

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,880
you cannot play without a mistake.
你不可能不犯错地打比赛

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,820
so, yeah, of course we did.
所以，是的，我们当然也犯了

5
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:13,140
so i want to do one thing with you: local words.
所以我想和你做一件事：本地词汇

6
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:13,520
and that's it.
就是这样

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,060
last year you learned more
去年你学了更多

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:20,400
and this year it's so simple: didao
今年来个简单的：地道

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,180
didao! didao!
地道！地道！

10
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:22,760
yeah!
对！

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,600
yes, and you want to say 'very',
对。那你想说“非常”的时候

12
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:40,800
before that, it is 'hen didao'
前面就是“很”——很地道

13
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,980
yes, i really like it
对，我很喜欢

14
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,000
once again, make some noise
再次请大家来点掌声

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,380
for kyousuke of team falcons!
送给Falcons的kyousuke！

16
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:59,610
（全场欢呼）
